### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health

### Create tenant
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Demo",
  "slug": "empresa-demo"
}

### Create company
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "REPLACE_TENANT_ID",
  "legalName": "Empresa Demo S.A.S.",
  "taxId": "900123456-7",
  "currency": "COP"
}

### Create payroll batch
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payroll-batches
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-payroll-001

{
  "companyId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "sourceAccountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "currency": "COP",
  "scheduledDate": "2026-06-01",
  "payments": [
    {
      "employeeDocumentType": "CC",
      "employeeDocumentNumber": "123456789",
      "employeeFullName": "Juan Perez",
      "bankCode": "001",
      "accountType": "SAVINGS",
      "accountNumber": "1234567890",
      "amount": 2500000
    }
  ]
}
